  moveName: Dragon Pulse
  description: "Hold to charge a pulse, slowing Duraludon by 30%. Charging increases damage and radius. After learning this move, attacks and moves apply up to six marks for 5s. The pulse consumes marks for additional damage, including missing-HP damage. A knockout reduces the cooldown by 30% and empowers three basic attacks for 8s; each deals bonus damage and reduces the cooldown by 1.5s. At level 11, knocking out an enemy player also restores 8% maximum HP."
